# K03 NS-ROLES-2 (Codex K03-NS-ROLES-2-20261007-20; docs/LMX_semantics.en.md#resolved-head-consumption,
# #declaration-visibility): a named Structure's body takes the common roles of the root and a method.
# Implementation limit (not a rule; Codex K03-NS2-COPY-ORACLE-20261007-22): `box: merge: Inner` in Host's body --
# merge run when Host runs, its result received in box -- is not built yet.  Said at the item once its operand is known.
Inner:
    int: v 1
end: Inner
Host:
    box: merge: Inner
end: Host
Host()
sendMessage: exit(exit_code: 7; stdout: ""; stderr: "")
return
